{
"dur": 62.394,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 9.433,
"text": "To understand Prime, you have to remember that Logan Paul and KSI were supposed to hate each other. In 2018 they fought twice, in front of millions.",
"end": 9.708
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 9.708,
"vo_start": 9.983,
"vo_end": 17.37,
"text": "So in January 2022, when the two rivals turned up together with a sports drink, the internet's reaction was simple. Wait, what?",
"end": 17.645
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 17.645,
"vo_start": 17.92,
"vo_end": 26.902,
"text": "Prime Hydration was made with Congo Brands, a company in Kentucky that already sold energy drinks. Logan and KSI were the faces. Their fans were the marketing.",
"end": 27.177
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 27.177,
"vo_start": 27.452,
"vo_end": 35.931,
"text": "And in Britain, it went nuclear. Early 2023, shoppers queued outside Aldi before opening time. Bottles sold out in minutes.",
"end": 36.206
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 36.206,
"vo_start": 36.481,
"vo_end": 43.904,
"text": "Kids traded it in the playground like Pok\u00e9mon cards. Some sellers asked silly money for a single bottle. Some schools banned it outright.",
"end": 44.179
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 44.179,
"vo_start": 44.454,
"vo_end": 53.883,
"text": "The numbers were real too. Bloomberg reported that Prime was heading for more than a billion dollars in yearly sales. At Walmart, it said it was outselling Gatorade.",
"end": 54.158
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 54.158,
"vo_start": 54.433,
"vo_end": 61.444,
"text": "Asked what it would be worth in a year, KSI said over a billion. Then he said: way beyond that.",
"end": 62.394
}
],
